        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin Colonial Mortise Privacy Bolt with Emergency Release Trim, BAL 6756/0406</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBaldwin's 6756 Privacy Bolt features the classic beauty that is iconic of colonial decor--simple, puritan, unadorned.  The beauty of function, expressed by the explicitness of form.   Mortise privacy bolts are most often used on bedrooms and bathrooms. This bolt is not meant for security purposes as, in case of emergencies, the bolt can be retracted from the exterior side of the door through the Colonial Emergency release rose. For doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick with 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Baldwin's 6756 Colonial Privacy Door Bolt with Emergency Release Trim\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Faceplate Height: 2/14\"</li>\r\n<li>Faceplate Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Rose Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Knob Height: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Trim Width:  11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Trim Height:  2-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" - 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\"or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Includes: faceplate, strike, dustbox, bolt, interior rose with turnpiece, emergency release exterior trim and emergency release key. \r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>**THESE ARE SPECIAL ORDER ONLY - LEAD TIME 5-6 WEEKS</b>\r\n<br><br>",
